# ZkFormal.NearV3.Extract.Ups.UpsLink — `upsV3` against the spec (M7e, steps 2–3 assembled)

For every instance `τ ≤ K`, with `T'_τ = fullTree R V' (headAt τ).rid` the lockstep post trie of the head of `τ`
